; --- Unload Filament Macro ---
; Heat hotend to safe unloading temperature (adjust if needed)
M104 S200           ; Set hotend temperature to 200 °C (non-blocking)
M109 S200           ; Wait until hotend reaches 200 °C

; Retract filament
G92 E0              ; Reset extruder position
G1 E-5 F1000        ; Initial small retraction
G1 E-400 F3000      ; Retract 100 mm of filament quickly

; Disable extruder motors
M84 E0:1 P3         ; Turn off extruder motors after 3 seconds

; Optional: user notification
M300                ; Beep (if supported)
M291 P"Filament unloaded. Remove it manually." R"Unload Complete" S1